		(libpart
			(lib "fcjamma")
			(part "PICO2")
			(description "Raspberry Pi Pico 2 (RP2350A) soldered flat on the board as a module.  1-40: the edge pads; D1-D3: the debug pads; TP1-TP6: the test pads on its underside (TP2/TP3 USB, TP6 BOOTSEL; TP4 and TP5 must not be used).  The Pico 2 has a seventh test pad, TP7 (1.1 V, do not use): the footprint has no pad there and the board must show bare solder mask under it.  GP0-GP22 tolerate 5 V only while the module is powered, GP26-GP28 never do")
			(fields
